    "identifier": "titanbound_colossus_engine",
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"715\">COLOSSUS ENGINE</h2><p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"783\"><em data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"783\">“If it was meant to stand forever, it would have asked me first.”</em></p><p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"915\">Colossus Engines are Titanbound who understand the battlefield as a structure — and structures can be broken.</p><p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1054\">They are not faster than enemies.<br data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"953\" />They are not smarter than enemies.<br data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"990\" />They apply force at the correct <strong data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1042\">structural point</strong> — and wait.</p><p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1106\">Where others deal damage, you advance <strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1105\">failure</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4251\">Colossus Engines are:</p><ul data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4326\"><li data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4270\"><p data-start=\"4254\" data-end=\"4270\">Siege-breakers</p></li><li data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4287\"><p data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4287\">Boss-solvers</p></li><li data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4326\"><p data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4326\">The answer when nothing else works</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4389\">They are not subtle.<br data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4351\" />The world remembers where they walked.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
